\n                },\n                {\n                  \"time\": \"15:00\",\n                  \"label\": \"Usability testing\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"ticketTypes\": [\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"Early Bird\",\n                  \"description\": \"Kuota terbatas\",\n                  \"price\": {\n                    \"amount\": 95000,\n                    \"currency\": \"IDR\"\n                  },\n                  \"quota\": 40,\n                  \"salesStartAt\": \"2026-03-15T00:00:00+07:00\",\n                  \"salesEndAt\": \"2026-04-10T23:59:00+07:00\"\n                },\n                {\n                  \"name\": \"Regular\",\n                  \"description\": \"Harga normal\",\n                  \"price\": {\n                    \"amount\": 125000,\n                    \"currency\": \"IDR\"\n                  },\n                  \"quota\": 80,\n                  \"salesStartAt\": \"2026-04-11T00:00:00+07:00\",\n                  \"salesEndAt\": \"2026-05-08T23:59:00+07:00\"\n                }\n              ],\n              \"publishSettings\": {\n                \"visibility\": \"public\",\n                \"publishMode\": \"scheduled\",\n                \"scheduledAt\": \"2026-03-15T09:00:00+07:00\",\n                \"allowWaitlist\": true,\n                \"showOnDiscovery\": true\n              },\n              \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:00:00+07:00\"\n            },\n            \"meta\": null\n          }\n\ndocs: |\n  # Event Create\n\n  Submit builder event (4 langkah).\n\n  | | |\n  | --- | --- |\n  | **Method** | `POST` |\n  | **Path** | `/org/experiences/events` |\n  | **Auth** | Wajib — `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>` |\n  | **Sukses** | `201 Created` |\n  | **Sumber** | `dto/organizer/event-create.request.json`<br>`dto/organizer/event-create.response.json` |\n\n  ## Request body\n\n  `application/json`\n\n  | Field | Tipe | Wajib | Catatan |\n  | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n  | `kind` | string | ya | enum `experienceKind`: `event`, `activity` |\n  | `identity` | object | ya |  |\n  | `identity.title` | string | ya |  |\n  | `identity.category` | string | ya |  |\n  | `identity.summary` | string | ya |  |\n  | `identity.coverImageUrl` | string | ya | URL |\n  | `brand` | object | ya |  |\n  | `brand.hostName` | string | ya |  |\n  | `brand.hostType` | string | ya |  |\n  | `brand.hostBio` | string | ya |  |\n  | `brand.logoUrl` | — | tidak | selalu `null` di contoh — tipe ditentukan backend |\n  | `brand.contactEmail` | string | ya | email |\n  | `brand.contactPhone` | string | ya |  |\n  | `benefits` | array | ya |  |\n  | `format` | string | ya | enum `eventFormat`: `onsite`, `online`, `hybrid` |\n  | `venue` | object | ya |  |\n  | `venue.name` | string | ya |  |\n  | `venue.area` | string | ya |  |\n  | `venue.city` | string | ya |  |\n  | `venue.address` | string | ya |  |\n  | `venue.latitude` | number | ya |  |\n  | `venue.longitude` | number | ya |  |\n  | `venue.notes` | array | ya |  |\n  | `onlineUrl` | — | tidak | selalu `null` di contoh — tipe ditentukan backend |\n  | `startsAt` | string | ya | ISO 8601 `+07:00` |\n  | `endsAt` | string | ya | ISO 8601 `+07:00` |\n  | `timezone` | string | ya |  |\n  | `rundown` | array | ya |  |\n  | `rundown[].time` | string | ya | jam `HH:mm` |\n  | `rundown[].label` | string | ya |  |\n  | `ticketTypes` | array | ya |  |\n  | `ticketTypes[].name` | string | ya |  |\n  | `ticketTypes[].description` | string | ya |  |\n  | `ticketTypes[].price` | integer | ya | integer polos di request (objek uang hanya di response) |\n  | `ticketTypes[].quota` | integer | ya |  |\n  | `ticketTypes[].salesStartAt` | string | ya | ISO 8601 `+07:00` |\n  | `ticketTypes[].salesEndAt` | string | ya | ISO 8601 `+07:00` |\n  | `publishSettings` | object | ya |  |\n  | `publishSettings.visibility` | string | ya | enum `visibility`: `public`, `unlisted`, `private` |\n  | `publishSettings.showOnDiscovery` | boolean | ya |  |\n  | `publishSettings.allowWaitlist` | boolean | ya |  |\n  | `publishSettings.publishMode` | string | ya | enum `publishMode`: `now`, `scheduled`, `draft` |\n  | `publishSettings.scheduledAt` | string | ya | ISO 8601 `+07:00` |\n\n  > Kolom **Wajib** diturunkan dari contoh: field yang bernilai `null`\n  > dianggap opsional. Aturan validasi sesungguhnya ditentukan backend.\n\n  ## `format` menentukan field mana yang wajib\n\n  `onsite` butuh `venue`; `online` butuh `onlineUrl`; `hybrid` butuh keduanya.\n  Langkah 2 builder berubah bentuk mengikuti pilihan ini, jadi validasi backend\n  sebaiknya ikut bersyarat, bukan mewajibkan semuanya sekaligus.\n\n  `rundown` adalah susunan acara `[{ time, label }]` — bukan `schedule`.\n\n  ## Error yang mungkin\n\n  | Kode | Contoh | Kapan |\n  | --- | --- | --- |\n  | `401` | `shared/common/error-unauthorized.response.json` | Token tidak ada atau kedaluwarsa. |\n  | `403` | `shared/common/error-forbidden.response.json` | Akun tidak punya peran `organizer`. |\n  | `422` | `shared/common/error-validation.response.json` | Validasi gagal; pesan per field ada di `error.errors`. |\n  | `500` | `shared/common/error-server.response.json` | Kesalahan tak terduga. |\n\n  Semua error memakai envelope yang sama ditambah blok `error`:\n\n  ```json\n  { \"success\": false, \"message\": \"…\", \"data\": null, \"meta\": null,\n    \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"errors\": { \"email\": [\"…\"] } } }\n  ```\n\n  ## Konvensi yang berlaku\n\n  - **Nama field** camelCase.\n  - **Uang** di response berbentuk `{ amount: integer, currency: \"IDR\" }`; di request integer polos.\n  - **Instant** (`createdAt`, `paidAt`, `startsAt`, `expiresAt`) ISO 8601 `+07:00`. Jam sesi berulang tetap `\"HH:mm\"`.\n  - **Enum** lowercase. Label berhuruf besar adalah urusan frontend.\n  - **Field nullable** tetap dikirim sebagai `null`, jangan dihilangkan.\n  - **`roles`** adalah array — satu akun bisa `[\"participant\", \"organizer\"]`.\n  - **Paginasi** `page` / `perPage`, dan `meta` berisi `{ page, perPage, total, totalPages }`.\n\n  Selengkapnya di `dto/README.md`.\n
