<+>info:\n  name: Login\n  type: http\n  seq: 2\n\nhttp:\n  method: POST\n  url: \"{{baseUrl}}/org/auth/login\"\n  headers:\n    - name: Content-Type\n      value: application/json\n  body:\n    type: json\n    data: |-\n      {\n        \"email\": \"adriani.ajeng@gmail.com\",\n        \"password\": \"RahasiaKu123\",\n        \"rememberMe\": true\n      }\n\nruntime:\n  assertions:\n    - expression: res.status\n      operator: lt\n      value: \"400\"\n    - expression: res.body.success\n      operator: eq\n      value: \"true\"\n  scripts:\n    - type: after-response\n      code: |-\n        const body = res.getBody();\n        if (body && body.success && body.data && body.data.accessToken) {\n          bru.setEnvVar(\"accessToken\", body.data.accessToken);\n          if (body.data.refreshToken) bru.setEnvVar(\"refreshToken\", body.data.refreshToken);\n          console.log(\"accessToken disimpan ke environment aktif\");\n        }\n    - type: tests\n      code: |-\n        test(\"envelope lengkap\", function () {\n          const body = res.getBody();\n          expect(res.getStatus()).to.be.below(400);\n          expect(body).to.have.property(\"success\", true);\n          expect(body).to.have.property(\"message\");\n          expect(body).to.have.property(\"data\");\n          expect(body).to.have.property(\"meta\");\n        });\n\nsettings:\n  encodeUrl: true\n  timeout: 0\n  followRedirects: true\n  maxRedirects: 5\n\nexamples:\n  - name: \"Sukses\"\n    response:\n      status: 200\n      statusText: OK\n      headers:\n        - name: Content-Type\n          value: application/json\n      body:\n        type: json\n        data: |-\n          {\n            \"success\": true,\n            \"message\": \"Berhasil masuk\",\n            \"data\": {\n              \"user\": {\n                \"id\": \"3f8a1c22-9d41-4b7e-8f0a-11c2d3e4f501\",\n                \"fullName\": \"Adriani Ajeng\",\n                \"email\": \"adriani.ajeng@gmail.com\",\n                \"phone\": \"+62 812 3456 7890\",\n                \"avatarUrl\": null,\n                \"roles\": [\n                  \"participant\",\n                  \"organizer\",\n                  \"teams_admin\"\n                ],\n                \"emailVerifiedAt\": \"2026-03-14T09:41:00+07:00\",\n                \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-14T09:30:00+07:00\"\n              },\n              \"tokenType\": \"Bearer\",\n              \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.mock-access-token\",\n              \"refreshToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.mock-refresh-token\",\n              \"expiresIn\": 3600,\n              \"expiresAt\": \"2026-03-14T10:30:00+07:00\"\n            },\n            \"meta\": null\n          }\n  - name: \"Kredensial salah\"\n    response:\n      status: 401\n      statusText: Unauthorized\n      headers:\n        - name: Content-Type\n          value: application/json\n      body:\n        type: json\n        data: |-\n          {\n            \"success\": false,\n            \"message\": \"Email atau password salah\",\n            \"data\": null,\n            \"meta\": null,\n            \"error\": {\n              \"code\": \"INVALID_CREDENTIALS\",\n              \"errors\": {\n                \"email\": [\n                  \"Kredensial tidak cocok\"\n                ]\n              }\n            }\n          }\n\ndocs: |\n  # Login\n\n  Masuk, mengembalikan token. **Jalankan ini lebih dulu** — script after-response menyimpan `accessToken` ke environment aktif, dan seluruh folder Admin membacanya.\n\n  | | |\n  | --- | --- |\n  | **Method** | `POST` |\n  | **Path** | `/org/auth/login` |\n  | **Auth** | Tidak perlu token |\n  | **Sukses** | `200 OK` |\n  | **Sumber** | `dto/shared/auth/login.request.json`<br>`dto/shared/auth/login.response.json`<br>`dto/shared/auth/login-invalid.response.json` |\n\n  ## Request body\n\n  `application/json`\n\n  | Field | Tipe | Wajib | Catatan |\n  | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n  | `email` | string | ya | email |\n  | `password` | string | ya |  |\n  | `rememberMe` | boolean | ya |  |\n\n  > Kolom **Wajib** diturunkan dari contoh: field yang bernilai `null`\n  > dianggap opsional. Aturan validasi sesungguhnya ditentukan backend.\n\n  ## Yang dilakukan script\n\n  Setelah response sukses, `accessToken` dan `refreshToken` ditulis ke environment\n  yang sedang aktif lewat `bru.setEnvVar`. Semua request lain di folder **Admin**\n  memakai `auth: inherit`, yang mengambil bearer token dari `Admin/folder.yml`\n  — jadi tidak ada yang perlu menempel token manual.\n\n  Akun contoh punya `roles: [\"participant\", \"organizer\", \"teams_admin\"]`. Guard\n  harus memakai `roles.includes(\"organizer\")`, bukan `roles === \"organizer\"`.\n\n  ## Error yang mungkin\n\n  | Kode | Contoh | Kapan |\n  | --- | --- | --- |\n  | `401` | `shared/auth/login-invalid.response.json` | Email atau password salah — lihat contoh kedua. |\n  | `422` | `shared/common/error-validation.response.json` | Validasi gagal; pesan per field ada di `error.errors`. |\n\n  Semua error memakai envelope yang sama ditambah blok `error`:\n\n  ```json\n  { \"success\": false, \"message\": \"…\", \"data\": null, \"meta\": null,\n    \"error\": { \"code\": \"VALIDATION_ERROR\", \"errors\": { \"email\": [\"…\"] } } }\n  ```\n\n  ## Konvensi yang berlaku\n\n  - **Nama field** camelCase.\n  - **Uang** di response berbentuk `{ amount: integer, currency: \"IDR\" }`; di request integer polos.\n  - **Instant** (`createdAt`, `paidAt`, `startsAt`, `expiresAt`) ISO 8601 `+07:00`. Jam sesi berulang tetap `\"HH:mm\"`.\n  - **Enum** lowercase. Label berhuruf besar adalah urusan frontend.\n  - **Field nullable** tetap dikirim sebagai `null`, jangan dihilangkan.\n  - **`roles`** adalah array — satu akun bisa `[\"participant\", \"organizer\"]`.\n  - **Paginasi** `page` / `perPage`, dan `meta` berisi `{ page, perPage, total, totalPages }`.\n\n  Selengkapnya di `dto/README.md`.\n
